Package: claudiousstatisticus
Title: Scatter Plots and PCA Biplots with 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Koshlan", email = "koshlan@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A small package that draws 'ggplot2' scatter plots of the
    built-in 'mtcars' and 'iris' datasets, runs centered and scaled principal
    component analysis on any dataset, and draws PCA biplots of the loadings.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    ggplot2,
    ggrepel,
    stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
